&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the SVP, Global Engineering and Infrastructure, the &lt;strong&gt;Senior Director of Health &amp;amp; Safety Operations Europe&lt;/strong&gt; serves as a strategic leader driving safety excellence across our European operations. You will champion the development and implementation of robust H&amp;amp;S strategies, ensuring full regulatory compliance while fostering a world-class safety culture. This role demands a visionary leader capable of influencing cross-functional teams and implementing industry-best practices to minimize risk and achieve ambitious safety performance goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and execute&lt;/strong&gt; the European H&amp;amp;S strategy, aligning safety milestones with broader business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultivate &lt;/strong&gt;a &quot;Zero Incident&quot; organizational culture by architecting risk-reduction programs across all operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safeguard &lt;/strong&gt;the business by ensuring rigorous compliance with local and international safety regulations and certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standardize&lt;/strong&gt; safety processes across diverse sites using our newly developed, proprietary safety framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner &lt;/strong&gt;with Supply Chain and Site Operations leadership to integrate safety into the heart of production practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage &lt;/strong&gt;data to track KPIs, providing senior leadership with actionable insights and performance reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead &lt;/strong&gt;high-stakes incident investigations, ensuring deep root-cause analysis and the execution of effective corrective actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act &lt;/strong&gt;as the primary representative for safety matters with regulatory bodies and external stakeholders across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate&lt;/strong&gt; internal and external safety audits to ensure consistent best-practice standards across all regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor &lt;/strong&gt;and develop a high-performing team of safety experts, fostering professional growth and succession planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pioneer &lt;/strong&gt;the use of AI and emerging technologies as accelerators for continuous improvement and safety innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of safety management experience, with at least 5 years in a high-impact leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subject matter expertise in European safety regulations, multi-national frameworks, and compliance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry background in FMCG, Logistics, Manufacturing, or Fulfillment preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of implementing scalable safety strategies across complex, international geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with the ability to translate safety data into strategic business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills, with the ability to influence and align diverse stakeholders at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A relentless passion for safety and a dedication to continuous operational improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership presence with a focus on empowering teams and maximizing individual potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the future of food:&lt;/strong&gt; Play a key role in transforming how millions of people eat as we grow into a global food solutions company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive transformational change:&lt;/strong&gt; Your decisions will have a direct and immediate impact, helping to shape strategy, scale teams, and redefine leadership in a rapidly evolving business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a global brand:&lt;/strong&gt; Create deeper, more sustainable connections with our customers, putting them at the heart of every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefit from long-term wealth creation:&lt;/strong&gt; Your compensation is heavily weighted toward equity, directly aligning your personal success with the company&#39;s future through our Virtual Stock Option (VSO) and Restricted Stock Unit (RSU) plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thrive in a high-performance environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with ambitious, intellectually curious peers on a global scale, enjoying an environment built for empowerment and speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Mission Brief&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Working Student in the Loads &amp;amp; Dynamics team, you will be at the heart of launch vehicle development. Every structural component, subsystem, and design decision ultimately depends on one fundamental question: what environments and loads will the vehicle experience during flight?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our team provides the engineering foundation that answers this question. By combining expertise in structural loads, dynamics, aerodynamics, thermal analysis, and fluid dynamics, we predict and characterize the complex physical environments encountered throughout all phases of flight.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will work directly with experienced engineers on real development activities, flight data analysis, and engineering methods used to support current and future launch vehicle programs. This role offers a unique opportunity to gain hands-on experience with aerospace engineering challenges while contributing to safe, reliable, and independent access to space.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart CommentHighlightPipeRest CommentHighlightRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot;&gt;Your Role in Our Space Mission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP CommentHighlightPipeRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Flight &amp;amp; Test Data Analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;
